(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF FOOD PROCESSING INDUSTRIES / MSME) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: PM FORMALISATION OF MICRO FOOD PROCESSING ENTERPRISES SCHEME \(PMFME\) / STATE NODAL AGENCIES \(SNA\) / NATIONAL INSTITUTE OF FOOD TECHNOLOGY \(NIFTEM\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Centrally sponsored scheme providing financial, technical, and business) Tj
T*
(support for the upgradation of micro food processing enterprises.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Existing or new micro food processing units \(Individual proprietors,) Tj
T*
(   SHGs, FPOs, Cooperatives\).) Tj
T*
(2. Enterprise must be involved in food processing and manufacturing.) Tj
T*
(3. Ownership status: Sole Proprietorship, Partnership, or LLP.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Credit-linked capital subsidy of 35% of eligible project cost with a) Tj
T*
(   maximum ceiling of Rs. 10 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 35.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 10.0 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Udyam / FSSAI Registration) Tj
T*
(2. Bank Account Statement \(6 months\)) Tj
T*
(3. Detailed Project Report \(DPR\)) Tj
T*
(4. Quotations for food processing machinery) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online via PMFME National Portal) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://pmfme.mofpi.gov.in) Tj
T*
ET
